# Public build configuration for the hosted Chapter (committed on purpose).
# Every value here ships to every browser anyway: the Supabase anon key is
# public by design (row-level security protects the data) and the RevenueCat
# key is a public SDK key. Never put a secret or a service_role key here.
# Variables set on the host (Vercel/Netlify) override these, so a fork can
# point at its own Supabase project.
